because the heat was expensive. There was

53
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:44,440
a grey hoodie I’d been looking for since
Christmas, and I’d assumed I left it at

54
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:47,400
my sister’s. A container
of leftover pasta I

55
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,640
was sure I hadn’t finished was gone from

56
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:52,180
